# Flutter Migration Strategy — UDAT Mobile App

> **Author**: Scout (Lead Architect)
> **Date**: 2026-03-10
> **Status**: Concept Brief — Awaiting Decision

## Requirement Summary

Convert the **UDAT** React PWA (audit platform) into a **Flutter mobile application** for internal distribution only (no public App Store listing). The app must preserve all core capabilities: offline-first audits, RBAC auth, real-time sync, scoring engine, photo capture, and action plan workflows.

