## 3. Feature-by-Feature Migration Map

### 3.1 Tier 1 — Critical Path (Must-Have for MVP)

| Feature | Current Tech | Flutter Equivalent | Complexity |
|---------|-------------|-------------------|------------|
| **Auth (RBAC)** | Supabase Auth + RLS | `supabase_flutter` — same auth, same RLS | 🟢 Low |
| **Template Viewer** | React components + TanStack Query | Riverpod + Supabase realtime | 🟡 Medium |
| **Audit Form** | React Hook Form + Zod | `flutter_form_builder` + custom validators | 🔴 High |
| **Scoring Engine** | `scoringEngine.ts` (pure logic) | Direct Dart port (pure functions) | 🟢 Low |
| **Photo Capture** | Web File API + Dexie blobs | `image_picker` + SQLite blobs | 🟡 Medium |
| **GPS Verification** | `useGps.ts` (Geolocation API) | `geolocator` plugin | 🟢 Low |
| **Offline Storage** | Dexie.js (IndexedDB) | **Drift** (SQLite) or **Isar** | 🔴 High |
| **Sync Engine** | Custom outbox + heartbeat | Custom Dart outbox + `connectivity_plus` | 🔴 High |
| **Action Plans** | CRUD + status machine | Standard Supabase CRUD | 🟡 Medium |

### 3.2 Tier 2 — Important (Post-MVP)

| Feature | Complexity | Notes |
|---------|------------|-------|
| **Dashboard Analytics** | 🟡 Medium | `fl_chart` for charts |
| **Notifications (Realtime)** | 🟡 Medium | `supabase_flutter` realtime channels |
| **AI Chat Assistant** | 🔴 High | SSE streaming in Dart, Generative UI |
| **Template Builder (Admin)** | 🔴 High | Complex drag-and-drop, consider leaving as web |
| **Dark Mode / Themes** | 🟢 Low | Flutter's `ThemeData` is excellent |
| **Push Notifications** | 🟡 Medium | `firebase_messaging` + APNs |

### 3.3 Tier 3 — Consider Keeping as Web

| Feature | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| **Template Builder** | Desktop-class UX with drag-and-drop. Better on web |
| **Admin User Management** | Rarely used in field. Keep as Supabase Dashboard or web admin |
| **System Logs Viewer** | Admin-only. Web is fine |

